137	    {
138	        String dialogue = "How to use:\n" +
139	                          "   - Use 'Play/Pause' button to stop and resume the simulation whilst in progress.\n" +
140	                          "   - Use the 'Run Long Sim' button to show the 500 steps of the simulation.\n" +
